## AVAILABLE SKILLS (invoke as slash commands)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

| Skill | When to Use |
|-------|-------------|
| `/safe-commit [message]` | Test + stage + commit with Conventional Commits |
| `/explain-code [path]` | Explain a file or function in simple terms |

## AVAILABLE AGENT DEFINITIONS (.grok/agents/)

| Agent | When to Use |
|-------|-------------|
| `code-reviewer` | Review code for security, perf, quality |
| `researcher` | Background research tasks (runs in parallel) |
| `test-writer` | Write unit/integration tests for existing code |
| `debugger` | Investigate bugs, trace root causes |
| `refactorer` | Safe code restructuring without behavior change |

