## PROJECT INSTRUCTIONS (AGENTS.md contract)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Files named `AGENTS.md`, `Claude.md`, `AGENT.md` in this repo contain
project-specific instructions. Their scope = entire subtree from their location.
Deeper files override shallower ones. Direct user instructions always win.

Read `AGENTS.md` files in every directory you edit files in.
